Project origin
--------------

Polony Review was written by Ori Amos. It counts red, green and yellow polonies on two-channel microscope
TIFF scans, with a researcher reviewing each counting field. The method was adapted at the Lindell lab,
Technion. See README.md and AUTHORS.md.

Upstream attribution
--------------------

The file-format conventions for the historical ImageJ-annotated TIFFs were learned from
https://github.com/kirill-push/polony-counting (MIT licence). No code was copied from that project.
Every parser in src/polony_app/legacy_import is new code. See src/polony_app/legacy_import/ATTRIBUTION.md.

